  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_jointur_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>something which fastens or connects, a fastener, tie, buckle, link etc. (MEd s.v. jointur n. 1c), here of latten | the meaning is not altogether clear. A joyntour is something which fastens or connects, a fastener, tie, buckle, link etc. (MEd s.v. jointur n. 1c), but what pro femina ('for women') might mean in this context is unclear</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
  </rdf:Description>
